#: src/features/buying/order-detail-page.tsx:339
msgid "Your bank filed a chargeback on this order. Stripe is handling the dispute with the seller; the outcome will appear here when it's decided."
msgstr "Chuir am banca agad cùl-fhiachadh air an òrdugh seo. Tha Stripe a' làimhseachadh na connspaid leis an reiceadair; nochdaidh an toradh an seo nuair a thèid co-dhùnadh."

#: src/features/listing/listing-page.tsx:883
msgid "Your bid was placed but immediately outbid. Another bidder has a higher maximum. Their bid is now {newBid}."
msgstr "Chaidh do thairgse a chur a-steach ach chaidh a thoirt seachad sa bhad. Tha tairgse nas àirde aig tairgear eile. Tha an tairgse aca a-nis {newBid}."

